id: underwater-beast
name: Underwater Beast
order: 21
description: >
  Adapted specifically for life under the surface of the water, you are a great swimmer.
text: >
  Underwater Beast: Adapted specifically for life under the surface of the water, you are a great swimmer.
  (1)-[Passive]: You cannot gain the Suffocating Combat Condition from the Underwater Battle Environment.
  (2)-[Passive]: While in the Underwater Battle Environment, increase your Defense Value and Speed by 1(bT), and ignore the penalties to your Speed from the Underwater Battle Environment.
  (3)-[Passive]: While in the Underwater Battle Environment, reduce the Ki Point Cost to use your Boosted Speed through the Movement Maneuver by 1(bT).
  (4)-[1/Round]: If you are in the Underwater Battle Environment, you can use the Movement Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) Its Unbreathable Environment ignored there; (2) the Speed it halves left whole (its own script, holdsTrait); (3).
if (inEnvironment("underwater")) {
    forbid unbreathableEnvironments;
    defenseValue += 1(bT);
    speed.normal += 1(bT);
    movement.boostedKiCost -= 1(bT);
}
# (4) The Movement Maneuver's Instant button there, once a Round (actor-character-sheet.mjs).
allow movement.underwaterInstant;
